{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with a golf club in hand, and a $100,000 fee looming overhead. Where did your car go? Who the hell is Luke Muscat? And is a hole-in-one even possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by  <strong>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</strong>, <strong>Trickshot Simulator</strong>, and <strong>The Stanley Parable</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS GOLF SWING SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to manipulate your hands, while also managing the angle and path of the club face. There are now infinite ways to hit a bad shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/cc912fa17a9e8e8fe240231069279135.poster.avif?t=1769649366\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/cc912fa17a9e8e8fe240231069279135.webm?t=1769649366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/cc912fa17a9e8e8fe240231069279135.mp4?t=1769649366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIT FROM ANYWHERE (SOMETIMES)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <span class=\"bb_strike\">giant trap</span> golf course in first person, and take your shots from anywhere. Hit anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/d4cc365526278b37a67eee926c954bc3.poster.avif?t=1769649366\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/d4cc365526278b37a67eee926c954bc3.webm?t=1769649366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/extras/d4cc365526278b37a67eee926c954bc3.mp4?t=1769649366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge was built almost entirely by me, Luke Muscat. The real Luke Muscat though, not the fictional Luke Muscat that traps you in the game. I know, it's confusing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in the <i>Before Times</i> I was creator of Jetpack Joyride and Fruit Ninja. Now I'm a solo indie developer with a Youtube channel.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510740?t=1769649366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/6ae3cc04a5c56bb1337d15f7cec3f3dbb15a2dca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769649366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/390013b88d37cc3897803e03f4fdd746d853f3a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769649366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/390013b88d37cc3897803e03f4fdd746d853f3a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769649366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with a golf club in hand, and a $100,000 fee looming overhead. Where did your car go? Who the hell is Luke Muscat? And is a hole-in-one even possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by  <strong>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</strong>, <strong>Trickshot Simulator</strong>, and <strong>The Stanley Parable</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS GOLF SWING SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to manipulate your hands, while also managing the angle and path of the club face. There are now infinite ways to hit a bad shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><